          "alias": "单女黑高领衫楼梯倚靠",
          "prompt": "In indoor staircase scenarios, the lighting is even and soft. In low-angle downward shots, the figure wears a black turtleneck cut-out knit sweater with clear texture and neat cutout edges; Underneath, she wears a black lace bra decorated with a black bow and delicate lace patterns; She wears a black cropped top paired with black long socks, which fit the legs snugly. She wears a black plush beret, with a soft plush texture. She leans forward, hands resting on the white stair railing, and her head turned toward the camera. The knit texture of the sweater, lace details on the bra, the sheen of long socks, and the plush texture of the beret are all highly faithful. The background features white stair railings and wooden steps, with natural textures on the walls.",
