          "prompt": "In indoor kitchen scenes, natural light and indoor lighting are blended to create a soft atmosphere. In the foreground, a woman wears a classic black-and-white maid outfit: a white headpiece (maid's headscarf) fitting the contours of the head, black decorative lines on the collar and hem of a white apron, and the black dress fabric naturally drapes. On the left, a hand (wearing white long-sleeved clothing) is handing out a cake. The background is the kitchen countertop, with glass cups, metal containers, and other items on the countertop, the background blurred. Overall, under warm lighting, the details are truly revealed.",
