          "prompt": "In nighttime or low-light environments, light illuminates the figure from below or from the side. In low-angle shots, the composition focuses on the person in the close-up or mid-shot. The figure wears a white backless top with cross-strap designs on the back, and the fabric naturally drapes to create pleats. His body was in a sideways position, holding a cigarette between his fingers, the tip faintly glowing. The background is a dark-toned outdoor environment with blurred outlines of trees or buildings. The lighting mainly illuminates the main subject, while the background is in low light to highlight the figure. The shape and brightness of the smoke are also clearly visible.",
