          "alias": "单女黑束身衣室内坐交叠",
          "prompt": "In indoor scenes with gray backgrounds, the lighting presents a red and blue effect, creating a contrast of light and shadow on the figures and the red eggshell chair. In the middle shot directly facing the camera, the figure sits on a red eggshell chair, legs crossed. Wear a black corset that hugs the body's curves and has a glossy surface; Wearing black knee-high socks that hug the leg lines; Wear a black wide-edge collar around the neck and a black wide-edge wrist bracelet on the wrist. Raise your right hand and hold up your black high heels. Details such as the corset stitching, the texture of the knee-high socks, the shine of the neck and wrist rings, the leather of the heels, and the curved shape and shine of the red chair are clearly presented. The background is evenly toned gray, and under mixed lighting, the overall detail is presented authentically.",
