          "alias": "黑泳装浴室蹲举手",
          "prompt": "In indoor bathroom scenes, the lighting is bright and even, coming from the ceiling of the space. In the medium shot, the figure is in a squatting position: left leg bent and extended forward, right leg bent to support the body, right hand raised close to the head, elbow bent, palm lightly touching the side of the head; Place your left hand on the ground in front of you, and your body weight rests on your right leg. Wearing a black-and-white one-piece swimsuit: the main body is black, with white fabric strips crossing the body, the left shoulder covered with a black strap, and the right shoulder with a white strap; The chest area has a hollowed-out area, with a white cloth strap wrapping and tiing around the waist; The swimsuit fabric hugs the body's curves, presenting natural drapes and subtle pleats. The layers are distinct. Pore details are clearly defined; The background features light-colored tiled walls, with a white column-style washbasin at the back. The countertop is clean, and the lines at the corners between the walls and countertops are straight. The whole piece looks authentic under bright lighting.",
