          "alias": "单女蓝高领衫街道注视",
          "prompt": "In outdoor street scenes, natural light is bright and abundant. In the medium shot, looking at the camera, the character wears a blue short-sleeved turtleneck top with a neckline that fits the curve of the neck, and the top has naturally draped pleated patterns; Paired with a light khaki skirt featuring double buttons, a wide belt at the waist with metal clasps, and a smooth hem. Carrying a white handbag in his right hand, lightly supporting his glasses with his left, and wearing a watch with a red strap on his wrist. The background is a city street environment: on the left side are light-colored building exterior walls, with utility poles and blue street signs on the walls; The ground was a gray asphalt pavement, with parking signs and blurry street trees visible in the distance. Pore details are clear, and the expression is natural. The whole piece looks authentic under bright lighting.",
