          "alias": "单女白衬衫楼梯坐",
          "prompt": "In outdoor staircase scenes, natural light shines from the top diagonally. In low-angle downward shots, the foreground features a metal mesh, with grid lines interlacing horizontally and vertically. The figure wears a white short-sleeved shirt with buttons at the collar, and the sleeves naturally fit to the arms; Paired with a green plaid mini skirt with neat hem edges; The light brown shoulder strap bag has double straps draped over the shoulders. The figure sits on the stairs, body slightly tilted, head turned toward the camera, with a red brick wall in the background, featuring black graffiti patterns (similar to a round bullseye). His expression was calm. In the overall natural light, the texture of the metal mesh, the wrinkles of the shirt fabric, the texture of the plaid short skirt, the gaps between bricks and graffiti on the red brick wall are all highly reproduced, presenting a realistic texture.",
