          "prompt": "In outdoor scenes, natural light shines from the rear diagonally, creating a bright lighting effect. In the medium shot, the figure stands sideways, with their head turned toward the camera. Wearing a pink short-sleeved top with naturally draped fabric, and a blurred pattern or text on the chest. The left shoulder has a dark shoulder strap (part of the backpack) that fits the shoulder curve. Natural demeanor, background elements: nearby is a silver car, with reflections of light on the body and shadows on the roof; The middle and background include trees (leaves have sunlight transmission) and buildings (exterior wall colors, windows, etc.), with background elements blurred due to lighting and depth. The whole piece presents a realistic texture under natural light.",
