          "alias": "单女外套雪地站立",
          "prompt": "In outdoor snowy scenes, natural light pours in evenly on cloudy days. In the middle shot, the figure wears a dark hooded jacket with a plaid hem, a light gray garment underneath, and a dark pleated skirt below. The figure stands beside the tracks, seemingly touching or exhaling to warm himself. The background is snow-covered ground, with tracks extending into the distance, with blurred outlines of trees or buildings on both sides, snowflakes drifting in the air, some clearly visible near the camera. Under uniform lighting, details such as the folds of the figures' clothing, the texture of the plaid hem, the drape of pleated skirts, as well as the texture of snowy surfaces, railway track contours, and the movement of falling snow are highly faithfully reproduced, presenting a realistic scene.",
