          "alias": "单女西装室内蹲交叠",
          "prompt": "In indoor scenes with a light gray solid background, the lighting is even and soft. In medium and close-up shots, the figure is in a squatting position, arms crossed in front of the body, head turned toward the camera. Wearing a white high-neck, long-sleeved tight suit with fabric that hugs the body's curves and a flat high neckline edge; She wears white patterned pantycoons, with the pattern clearly extending across her legs; She wears white pointed high heels, with smooth uppers reflecting a faint glow. Neat and fitting, wearing gold round earrings on the earlobes, with the metal surface reflecting light. Pore details are visible, clothing details: bodysuits form natural pleats with the body's movements, tight stockings have distinct cutouts and textures, and the leather texture of high heels feels authentic. The whole thing is presented in realistic detail under uniform lighting.",
