          "alias": "单女毛衣楼梯沉思站立",
          "prompt": "In outdoor staircase scenarios, natural light is bright and abundant. In low-angle downward shots, the subject is positioned slightly above the center of the frame. Wearing a loose burgundy knit sweater with a clear knit texture and natural drape; Wearing a gray form-fitting short skirt that reaches the upper thighs; She wears black over-the-knee high-heeled boots, with a reflective texture on the leather surface. The figure is in a standing position, with the right leg in front and the left leg behind on the stair steps, the body slightly turned toward the camera, and the head turned toward the camera. His expression was calm. The background features a light gray concrete staircase, with clear steps and natural shadows along the edges; The middle and rear scenes are modern building exterior walls, where glass curtain walls and concrete structures are visible, and the glass reflects the environment; On the right side of the image is a dark-colored pipeline device. Under bright natural light, the knit texture of sweaters, the reflection of boot leather, the concrete texture of stairs, and architectural glass details are highly faithfully reproduced, presenting authentic physical attributes.",
