          "prompt": "On a light gray solid background, the lighting is even and soft. In the full-body composition, the figure stands in the center of the frame, slightly tilted body with hands placed behind him. She wore a white sleeveless jumpsuit with a stand collar that fits the neck, a cut-out neckline, and a natural folded texture on the chest; The waist is cinched to fit the body's curves, with a double-layered white puffy skirt hem, and the outer edge of the skirt naturally undulating in waves. She wears white long socks on her legs, with pleated lace decorations at the cuff, and the socks fit closely against the skin of her legs. The details of the garment pleats, the layering of the skirt hem, and the lace on the sock cuffs are clearly detailed, reproducing the real material under uniform lighting.",
