        {
          "id": "krea2-0502105002ea250540021948",
          "alias": "单女灰毛衣楼梯沉思站立持相机",
          "prompt": "In indoor staircase scenarios, natural light streams in through glass windows above and on the sides, creating an overall bright and even atmosphere. In the medium and near shot, the figure stands on the stairway steps, body slightly turned toward the camera, head turned toward the lens, wearing a light gray knit cardigan with a white shirt underneath with a neat neckline; Wearing a dark gray pleated short skirt, the hem naturally hanging down; A white leather crossbody bag worn crossbody, with shoulder straps that fit snugly in front. Gently hold the stair railing with your left hand, let your right hand hang naturally, and stand relaxed. The background is a modern staircase space: black and white decorative lines along the edges of the steps, white handrails paired with metal railings; Behind it is a transparent glass wall, allowing you to see the outdoor light and the silhouette of the building; The ceiling is embedded with rectangular lighting fixtures, and the walls are light-toned. Pore details are clearly defined; His demeanor was gentle. Clothing details: The knit cardigan has delicate textures, with pleats naturally rising and falling with the body's posture; The shirt collar is crisp, and the fabric feels authentic; The pleated short skirt has evenly folded pleats and a noticeable drape; The leather texture and metal clasp details of the crossbody bag are sharp. Environmental elements: The non-slip edges of stair steps, the reflective effects of glass walls, and the outlines of ceiling fixtures are all clearly presented. Overall, under bright lighting, the texture feels authentic.",
