          "alias": "单女棕外套车内倚靠持花",
          "prompt": "Inside the car, natural light filters through the windows to create a bright and soft lighting environment. In the foreground composition, she wears a light brown coat with subtle textures on the fabric, paired with white clothes underneath; Both hands are placed in front, one holding a transparent plastic cup filled with a light brown liquid and a straw, while the other hand holds a white bouquet with natural flower shapes. The figure leans slightly to the side, sitting in a seat inside the car, with legs relaxed and bent. Pore details are clear, expression calm. Background elements include dark-colored seats inside the cabin, with leather textures on the seat surfaces; The green plants outside the window create a blurred background, and the leaves appear in layers of light and shadow under the light. The whole piece presents a realistic texture under natural light.",
