          "prompt": "In indoor scenes, natural light streams in through the rear side windows, creating soft illumination. In the medium shot, the figure sits on a light gray sofa, sitting in a relaxed posture, with the back slightly leaning against the sofa backrest. The left leg is bent and the right leg naturally extended, with the left arm resting on the sofa backrest and the right arm resting on the right knee. Wearing light blue lace lingerie with straps that fit the shoulder curve, the lingerie texture clearly visible; Layered with a white, lightweight shirt, the shirt naturally drapes down the sides of the body, with fabric pleats appearing with movement. The background features rectangular windows with light brown wooden frames, light beige curtains that are semi-translucent, and light filtering through the curtains creates soft shadows on the walls and floor. Clothing details: The lace lingerie's cutout texture and transparent texture are sharply presented, while the white shirt's lightweight material and pleated texture are clearly visible; Background elements: The sofa surface has natural wrinkled textures, the wooden window frame's texture and color are authentic, and the curtain fabric transitions naturally in light and shadow. The whole is presented in soft light, presenting authentic details.",
