          "prompt": "In nighttime city street scenes, mixed light sources create neon lighting environments. Using a low-angle side composition, the figure sits on a metal railing, their bodies facing the camera sideways. She wears a white short-sleeved T-shirt over a loose black jacket (the jacket has natural pleats at the shoulders, with the hem draping down when seated), light-colored shorts, and white sneakers. Bend your left leg and place it on the base of the railing, let your right leg hang naturally, hold the railing with your right hand, lightly rest your left hand on your right leg, and lean your body slightly backward. The background is a bustling street: the nearby road shows the light of vehicle tracks; The blurred figures of pedestrians in the middle frame; The distant view features rows of skyscrapers and large neon billboards (with vibrant colors and varying lighting layers), while distant streetlights emit a warm yellow halo. Under mixed lighting, it presents a realistic urban nightscape texture.",
