          "alias": "单女毛衣户外微笑站立比耶",
          "prompt": "In the outdoor castle scene, natural light shines from diagonally above. In the medium shot, the figure wears a white, lightweight cardigan. The fabric drapes naturally to create soft pleats, layered with a deep blue spaghetti strap long dress. The deep V neckline fits the neck, the straps fit the shoulder curve, and the dress fabric has a natural drape. A black shoulder bag with a red and white spiral pattern on the bag, with a clear contrast in the color patterns. Raise your left hand in a V-sign gesture, let your right hand hang down naturally, and stand sideways facing the camera. The background features gray-black stone castle buildings, with clear surface textures, arched windows, and detailed stone walls. The floor is paved with stone slabs, with visible gaps and textures, and faint pedestrians in the distance. With a smile, the folds of the cardigan fluctuate naturally with movement, the drape of the slip dress is obvious, and the shoulder bag pattern is sharp; The castle architecture features brick and stone patterns and clear window outlines; The gaps in the ground slabs are sharp. In the overall natural light, the textures of people, clothing, accessories, and buildings are highly reproduced, presenting authentic details.",
