          "alias": "单女全裸制服室内坐",
          "prompt": "In indoor light-toned room scenes, the lighting is even and soft. In the full-body composition, the figure wears a flight attendant-style uniform: a gray dress with gold buttons, a red belt tied around the waist, and a colorful silk scarf wrapped around the neck (the scarf has clear texture and distinct color layers). Sit on a white countertop, rest your left leg over your right, gently adjust the edge of your flesh-colored stockings with your left hand, and place a pair of black high heels on the floor at your feet (smooth shape with sharp details on the red sole). His demeanor was calm and natural. Clothing details: The dress fabric is crisp, with metal buttons that reflect naturally; The red belt has a soft sheen and clear knotting patterns; The color transitions of the silk scarf pattern are natural; Nude stockings fit the legs snugly, with delicate and realistic textures. Background element: Light beige walls, with white cabinets with vertical striped textures on the sides, and straight lines along the countertop edges. The whole thing is presented in realistic detail under uniform lighting.",
