          "prompt": "In the rainy night city street scene, the camera presents the image at a low angle, with compositions including the backs of the figures and background elements. Located in the lower middle part of the frame, she wears a dark coat with reflective effects from rainwater seeping on the coat surface. There are rainwater marks at the hem of the shirt. The figure walks on a damp street surface, with obvious reflections that reflect the surrounding light, and the footsteps have areas formed by water accumulation. In the background, there is a tram with warm yellow headlights, rain marks on the windows, and an electronic display screen on the body. Buildings on both sides of the street are illuminated, and vehicle and building lights form light bands in the rain and fog, with the edges of the light strips diffusing and blurred due to rain, fog, and humidity. The overall lighting consists of streetlights, car lights, and architectural lights, with warm yellow and orange-red tones as the main tones, creating scattered effects in rainy night environments. Presenting the true environmental features of rainy nights.",
